Malemba chikafika: ['html'] chitani: { <- (
		wekha
		sinthani: ['&'] ndi: ['&amp;'],
		sinthani: ['<'] ndi: ['&lt;'],
		sinthani: ['>'] ndi: ['&gt;'],
		sinthani: ['"'] ndi: ['&quot;']
	).
}.

>> list := Mndandanda chatsopano.

['Verbatim Syntax'] zilembo chilichonse: { :nambala :letter
	list ; ((['<li>#Number:Letter</li>']) Number: (nambala), Letter: letter).
}.

Zotuluka list.





>> template := ['
<html>
<body>
<p>Hello this is a test!</p>
<p>The string \‘Verbatim Syntax\’ has: 15 code points...</p>
<ul>
[list]
</ul>
</body> 
</html>
'] [list]: (list lumikiza: ['↵']).

Zotuluka lembani: template.

